    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You return to your mother\u2019s house. The door was open. The place is a mess\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Is Mother</strong> is a psychological horror narrative game with no HUD and no combat. Explore a realistic, heavy atmosphere in first person \u2014 a place filled with memories, silence\u2026 and something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discomfort of being alone in a home that used to feel safe\u2026 and might now be haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Realistic and immersive atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udd38 Environmental storytelling and scattered past<br>\ud83d\udd38 A short, intense and disturbing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game explores themes like mental illness, guilt, and isolation.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You return to your mother\u2019s house. The door was open. The place is a mess\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Is Mother</strong> is a psychological horror narrative game with no HUD and no combat. Explore a realistic, heavy atmosphere in first person \u2014 a place filled with memories, silence\u2026 and something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discomfort of being alone in a home that used to feel safe\u2026 and might now be haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Realistic and immersive atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udd38 Environmental storytelling and scattered past<br>\ud83d\udd38 A short, intense and disturbing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game explores themes like mental illness, guilt, and isolation.</i></p>",
